        "name": "Set base path",
        "func": "//restrict to c:\\temp\\\nvar basePath = \"/home/picg/node-red-static/\";\nvar filename = msg.req.params.fn;\n\n\nif(filename.includes(\"..\\\\\")){\n    msg.payload = \"Illegal file path\";\n    msg.statusCode = 405;//not allowed\n    return [null, msg];//fire output 2\n} else if(filename.includes(\"../\")){\n    msg.payload = \"Illegal file path\";\n    msg.statusCode = 405;//not allowed\n    return [null, msg];//fire output 2\n} \n//TODO: add more checks\n\nmsg.filename = basePath + filename;\nreturn [msg, null];//fire output 1\n\n\n",
